# Archived case sets: generated material, same reason as the sets above.
benchmarks/ai_coding/cases_archive/

# Every generated case set, by shape rather than by name. The `_rev*` pattern above missed
# `_raw2026`, `_geninput`, `_retrytest`, `_clean2026` and `_retryout`, and `git add -A` then
# committed 3,551 files of verbatim production source — including a live `sk-` key, a mail
# authorization code and an engineer's home path. Naming each new set in this file is a step
# that gets skipped; matching the directory that holds them is not.
benchmarks/ai_coding/cases/*/
!benchmarks/ai_coding/cases/.gitkeep
